{"synopsis":"Chu Xuan melintasi alam semesta Cangxuan yang luas, menjadi seorang murid sederhana dari Sekte Wuji setelah terlahir kembali. Mencari ilmu sebagai seorang pengikut ilmu sihir berarti merebut inti dari langit dan bumi, serta merampas vitalitas dari berbagai makhluk. Membantai kehidupan dalam jumlah tak terhitung adalah jalan untuk menjadi dewa setan tertinggi yang dihormati di seluruh jagat. Namun, tindakan membunuh dianggap tidak dapat diterima oleh Dao manusia dari sekte-sekte yang benar. Akhirnya, Sekte Wuji dihancurkan oleh sekte-sekte ortodoks.","alternative_title":"Rebirth of a Dark Mage: Unveiling a Zombie Planet from the Start","author":"Flower model worker","artist":"], Flower model worker [Add","chapters":[{"number":"45","chapter":"45","slug":"999de0fd-3038-4805-a631-5b3b74b38cd4","date":"2025-07-03","images":[]},{"number":"44","chapter":"44","slug":"c2bea65e-f555-4cf4-9f4f-aa1a7a351d0d","date":"2025-06-25","images":[]},{"number":"43","chapter":"43","slug":"99bed2fa-056c-41f8-bd92-d9e937eb4bef","date":"2025-06-21","images":[]},{"number":"42","chapter":"42","slug":"105f170b-7159-49a4-b604-7fd672f0a13d","date":"2025-06-15","images":[]},{"number":"41","chapter":"41","slug":"de82adda-2873-4999-93d6-13b9fff6d34d","date":"2025-06-15","images":[]},{"number":"40","chapter":"40","slug":"b1a0142c-ca18-4b8e-8725-1face1d9c4fa","date":"2025-05-28","images":[]},{"number":"39","chapter":"39","slug":"c7d4d05b-c9c8-44a2-9a44-869aaba2f970","date":"2025-05-19","images":[]},{"number":"38","chapter":"38","slug":"845fc540-82da-46ce-86ba-d5092c151988","date":"2025-05-17","images":[]},{"number":"37","chapter":"37","slug":"886da27a-f625-4e20-a9fb-6f92ecde642b","date":"2025-05-17","images":[]},{"number":"36","chapter":"36","slug":"b1aa9f4c-d7b4-445b-b001-2317027cf0e2","date":"2025-04-28","images":[]},{"number":"35","chapter":"35","slug":"4b80efa0-cd87-42bc-9ce7-6cd9a17cc9f6","date":"2025-04-21","images":[]},{"number":"34","chapter":"34","slug":"3d20b1ed-725f-453d-8b58-9